configurable_props.description:
Use this field to enter multiple registrants at once. Will override the single registrant fields if provided. Each registrant should be an object with at least the following properties: email, first_name, last_name. Example:
      `[
        {
          "email": "test@example.com",
          "first_name": "John",
          "last_name": "Doe"
        }
      ]`
